@startuml
title Implemented lookahead path: shared trace to prefix-compressed delivery

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #374151
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
}

rectangle "BFS / graph search\nselect one COMM" as Search #DBEAFE
rectangle "ReductionTrace\nArc root + parent-linked tail\ncomplete process configurations" as Trace #EDE9FE
rectangle "Leaf materialization\n[input, initial, state1, ..., terminal]" as Entry #FEF3C7
rectangle "EPathMap set mode\nPathMap<()>\none canonical key per trace" as Trie #DCFCE7
rectangle "EPM1\nACTree03 prefix topology\nno Par value table" as Wire #D1FAE5

Search --> Trace : extend in constant time
Trace --> Entry : iterative leaf-to-root fill
Entry --> Trie : encode_trie_path
Trie --> Wire : protobuf or bincode

note bottom of Trace #F5F3FF
  Sibling branches share parent links.
  Clone increments Arc; Drop unwraps
  the unique suffix iteratively.
end note

note bottom of Trie #ECFDF5
  PathMap owns canonical order,
  deduplication, prefix compression,
  algebra, and zipper navigation.
end note
@enduml
